    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>NOW HIRING:</strong><em><strong>&nbsp;</strong></em><strong>MAINTENANCE ASSISTANT</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Complete Care at Kimberly Hall South is a pillar in the community of Windsor, CT.&nbsp; We approach every day with one goal:&nbsp; To improve the lives we touch through high-quality healthcare and extraordinary compassion. Now hiring: Maintenance Assistant.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>Complete Care at Kimberly Hall South</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">South Building, 1 Emerson Drive</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Windsor, CT 06095</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">860-688-6443</span></p>\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Why work for us?&nbsp;</span></strong></em></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>You will have the opportunity to build a career with an established, highly successful organization in a caring and compassionate environment.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>We are committed to your growth and success.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Come join employees who have become family!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Work today, get paid today!&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><strong>Now Hiring:</strong>&nbsp;Maintenance Assistant</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Job Type:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Full-time 30 hours</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><em><strong>Responsibilities of a Maintenance Assistant:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Troubleshoot building mechanical problems.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Perform miscellaneous repairs, scheduled, and preventative maintenance on equipment ensuring satisfactory operations.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Working knowledge of electrical systems, various heating, ventilating, and air conditioning systems.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Follow established safety rules, policies, and procedures of the maintenance department.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Other duties as assigned by the Maintenance Director and Administrator.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><em><strong>Qualifications of a Maintenance Assistant:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>High School Diploma or equivalent.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Ability to work independently or part of a group.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">&bull;<span style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span>Computer knowledge.</span>